{"id":"63953abf34ba454e","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-forces-ch.md","title":"ZFC Forces CH","display":"df-zfc-forces-ch — ZFC Forces CH","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forces-ch","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forces-ch"],"display":"df-zfc-forces-ch — ZFC Forces CH","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-ch.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-logic.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forces-ch"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forces-ch</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forces-ch — ZFC Forces CH"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a8e91517c28976b8\" href=\"?note=a8e91517c28976b8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ch.md\">../batch14/58-df-ch.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d413862f4ab047c8\" href=\"?note=d413862f4ab047c8\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md\">../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"44e32f3fb4334e0c\" href=\"?note=44e32f3fb4334e0c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-logic.md\">../batch17/58-df-logic.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (ground model) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb 1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb 1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\)</span> (forcing notion, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d413862f4ab047c8\" href=\"?note=d413862f4ab047c8\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md\">../batch13/58-df-forcing-notion.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\Vdash_{M,P}\\varphi\">\\(p\\Vdash_{M,P}\\varphi\\)</span> (forcing relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingNotion}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingNotion}_S\\)</span> (forcing-notion predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span> (language of set theory) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span> (set-coded sentences)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{\\mathrm{CH}}\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\chi_{\\mathrm{CH}}\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span> (the set-coded continuum-hypothesis sentence defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ForcesCH}\">\\(\\operatorname{ForcesCH}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forces\\text{-}ch\\text{-}sentence} \\vdash \\chi_{\\mathrm{CH}}\\coloneqq\\ulcorner |\\mathcal P(\\omega)|=\\aleph_1\\urcorner\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forces\\text{-}ch\\text{-}sentence} \\vdash \\chi_{\\mathrm{CH}}\\coloneqq\\ulcorner |\\mathcal P(\\omega)|=\\aleph_1\\urcorner\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forces\\text{-}ch} \\vdash \\operatorname{ForcesCH}(M,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb 1_{\\mathbb P}\\;\\bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb 1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ForcingNotion}_S(\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathbb 1_{\\mathbb P}\\Vdash_{M,P}\\chi_{\\mathrm{CH}}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forces\\text{-}ch} \\vdash \\operatorname{ForcesCH}(M,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb 1_{\\mathbb P}\\;\\bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb 1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ForcingNotion}_S(\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathbb 1_{\\mathbb P}\\Vdash_{M,P}\\chi_{\\mathrm{CH}}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“The forcing notion forces CH” means that its greatest condition forces the set-coded CH sentence over the displayed ground model; neither the condition nor the model is implicit. The Boolean <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CH}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CH}_S\\)</span> from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a8e91517c28976b8\" href=\"?note=a8e91517c28976b8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ch.md\">../batch14/58-df-ch.md</a> is a metalevel truth value and is therefore not passed as an object-language formula to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash\">\\(\\Vdash\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ch.md","status":"resolved","id":"a8e91517c28976b8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ch.md]]","embed":fal